1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,297
Inventing a
religion?

2
00:00:01,317 --> 00:00:02,647
Don't start with
gods.

3
00:00:02,667 --> 00:00:04,034
What do people fear?

4
00:00:04,054 --> 00:00:05,407
Meet the Lamplight
faith.

5
00:00:05,427 --> 00:00:07,042
They pray to an
empty sky.

6
00:00:07,062 --> 00:00:09,219
The lazy version:
twelve gods first,

7
00:00:09,239 --> 00:00:10,421
one job each.

8
00:00:10,441 --> 00:00:11,470
Press run.

9
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:12,295
Shrines rise.

10
00:00:12,315 --> 00:00:13,220
Nobody comes.

11
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:14,600
The lamps go out.

12
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:16,909
Nobody prays to a
god they don't need.

13
00:00:16,929 --> 00:00:18,647
Real faith starts in
the dark.

14
00:00:18,667 --> 00:00:20,109
Four fears come
first.

15
00:00:20,129 --> 00:00:21,638
The fifth is the
twist.

16
00:00:21,658 --> 00:00:22,600
One:
death.

17
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:24,188
Candles keep the
dead company at the

18
00:00:24,208 --> 00:00:24,875
cairn.

19
00:00:24,895 --> 00:00:25,888
Two:
the lake.

20
00:00:25,908 --> 00:00:27,617
No boat leaves
without a lamp.

21
00:00:27,637 --> 00:00:28,595
Three:
hunger.

22
00:00:28,615 --> 00:00:30,296
Hoarding grain
becomes a sin.

23
00:00:30,316 --> 00:00:31,533
Four:
the eclipse.

24
00:00:31,553 --> 00:00:33,456
Keepers rise to read
the sky.

25
00:00:33,476 --> 00:00:34,242
Run it again.

26
00:00:34,262 --> 00:00:35,355
Five hundred years.

27
00:00:35,375 --> 00:00:37,120
Every lamp still
burns.

28
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:37,820
Rule five?

29
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:38,870
The deepest fear.

30
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:40,417
That nobody is
listening.

31
00:00:40,437 --> 00:00:41,930
So they made someone
who listens.

32
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:42,962
A god.

33
00:00:42,982 --> 00:00:45,098
Write it last,
and it feels real.

34
00:00:45,118 --> 00:00:46,494
Gods don't come
first.

35
00:00:46,514 --> 00:00:48,307
Every god answers a
fear.

36
00:00:48,327 --> 00:00:49,709
What question would
your people ask

37
00:00:49,729 --> 00:00:50,681
their gods?

38
00:00:50,701 --> 00:00:52,400
Part 33 of 50.

39
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:55,637
Follow for part 34:
the gods are lying.
